                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO3__1BLOCK_4TO1  :  From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:3 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:1 blocks. " = 0x122, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO3__1BLOCK_4TO2  :  From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:3 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:2 blocks. " = 0x123, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__2BLOCKS_4TO3  :  From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sectors 0 & 1 were compressed as 4:3 blocks. " = 0x124, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO3__1BLOCK_4TO4  :  From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:3 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:4 (uncompressed). " = 0x125, 
