                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO4__1BLOCK_4TO2  :  From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:4 (uncompressed) and sector 0 was compressed as 4:2 blocks. " = 0x127, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO4__1BLOCK_4TO3  :  From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:4 (uncompressed) and sector 0 was compressed as 4:3 blocks. " = 0x128, 
