                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_2TO2__1BLOCK_2TO1__1BLOCK_4TO2  :  From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 2 was compressed as 2:2 (uncompressed), sector 1 was compressed as 2:1 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:2 blocks. " = 0x132, 
