                    kinds of quads.  {emulated, global, C1} " = 0xb, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_EVENTS  :  Number of events sent to SQs.  {unwindowed, emulated, global} " = 0xc, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_WAVES_EQ_64  :  Count number of waves with exactly 64 active items sent to SQs. {emulated, global, C1} " = 0xd, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_WAVES_LT_64  :  Count number of waves with <64 active items sent to SQs. {emulated, global, C1} " = 0xe, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_WAVES_LT_48  :  Count number of waves with <48 active items sent to SQs. {emulated, global, C1} " = 0xf, 
