                    {nondeterministic, unwindowed, global} " = 0x14, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_MSG_GSCNT  :  Number of GSCNT messages.  {emulated, unwindowed, global} " = 0x15, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_MSG_INTERRUPT  :  Number of interrupt messages.  {emulated, unwindowed, global} " = 0x16, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_Reserved_1  :  counter removed " = 0x17, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_Reserved_2  :  counter removed " = 0x18, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_Reserved_3  :  counter removed " = 0x19, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_WAVE_CYCLES  :  Number of clock cycles spent by waves in the SQs.  Incremented by # of
                    living (valid) waves each cycle.  {nondeterministic, C1} " = 0x1a, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_WAVE_READY  :  Number of clock cycles waves were ready to execute the next instruction.
                    Incremented by # of waves ready to issue an instruction each cycle.  This
