                            "ge_vs_starving_for_pc_grant  :  Legacy side has a VS wave ready to launch but it is waiting for PC grant. This counter can be used in streaming mode along with the pc_space_zero counter to see if unizfied PC manager is creating serialization in GE " = 0x7f, 
