                            "ge_ngg_starved_idle  :  number of cycles ngg is starving for work within a draw. This counter is used to calculate ngg prim and vert rate. vert_rate = ge_se_spi_esvert_valid/(ge_esvert_send + ge_ngg_starved_idle + ge_se_spi_esvert_starved_busy + ge_se_spi_esvert_stalled) and prim_rate = ge_se_spi_gsprim_valid/(ge_gsprim_send + ge_ngg_starved_idle + ge_se_spi_gsprim_starved_busy + ge_se_spi_gsprim_stalled) " = 0x83, 
