                            "ge_se_vs_cache_hits  :  number of parameter cache hits due to an API VS " = 0x67, 
                            "ge_se_vs_done  :  Counts number of VS DONES received by the VGT.  Sensitive to PERF_SEID_IGNORE_MASK " = 0x68, 
                            "ge_se_vs_table_high_water_mark  :  Records maximum number of VS waves outstanding in the VS table.  Counter select must be set to MAX mode " = 0x69, 
                            "ge_se_vs_thread_groups  :  Count of thread groups issued to the VS (these are Domain Shader Threadgroups).  Sensitive to PERF_SEID_IGNORE_MASK " = 0x6a, 
                            "ge_se_vsvert_api_send  :  number of API VS verts sent across the vsvert interface.  only valid when tessellation and GS are off. " = 0x6b, 
                            "ge_se_vsvert_ds_send  :  number of DS verts sent across the vsvert interface.  only valid when GS is off. " = 0x6c, 
                            "ge_se_wait_for_es_done_stalled  :  GS thread SM is ready to move to the next stage as soon as the ES thread finishes " = 0x6d, 
