                            "ge_se_spi_gssubgrp_event_window_active  :  number of cycles the event window is active for a GS subgroup event " = 0x70, 
                            "ge_se_hs_input_stall  :  In gen0 and gen1 BC modes the HS input (TG) FIFO hides the LS latency. In gen2 mode the FIFO serves as a buffer, that breaks the back pressure chain, prior to sending HS waves to the SPI. It is not an important counter for gen2. " = 0x71, 
                            "vgt_se_pa0_clipv_starved_busy  :  PA clipv interface is starved while GE is busy " = 0x72, 
