                            "ge_se_sclk_input_vld  :  Counts number of cycles sclk_input is valid " = 0x79, 
                            "ge_spi_lswave_fifo_full_stall  :  lswave fifo in HS block is going full. This FIFO keeps a count of number of LSwaves in the threadgroup " = 0x7a, 
                            "ge_spi_hswave_fifo_full_stall  :  hswave fifo in HS block is going full. This FIFO keeps a count of number of HSwaves in the threadgroup " = 0x7b, 
