                            "vgt_se_pa1_clips_starved_busy  :  PA clips interface is starved while GE is busy " = 0x77, 
                            "ge_se_sending_vert_or_prim  :  This is an efficiency counter for GE_SPI transfers. It counts when the GE makes either a vert or a prim transfer to SPI on NGG pipeline " = 0x78, 
                            "ge_se_sclk_input_vld  :  Counts number of cycles sclk_input is valid " = 0x79, 
