                            "ge_hs_tif_stall  :  Stall on putting entries into HS Threadgroup Interface FIFO. " = 0x7c, 
                            "ge_csb_spi_bp  :  GE cannot send subgroup on PA Control Sideband interface because of backpressure. " = 0x7d, 
                            "ge_ngg_starving_for_pc_grant  :  NGG has a subgroup ready to launch but it is waiting for PC grant. This counter can be used in streaming mode along with the pc_space_zero counter to see if unizfied PC manager is creating serialization in GE " = 0x7e, 
                            "ge_vs_starving_for_pc_grant  :  Legacy side has a VS wave ready to launch but it is waiting for PC grant. This counter can be used in streaming mode along with the pc_space_zero counter to see if unizfied PC manager is creating serialization in GE " = 0x7f, 
                            "ge_strmout_stalled  :  output block waiting for its turn on the streamout bus " = 0x80, 
