                            "GL2C_PERF_SEL_MDC_INV_METADATA  :  Number of cycles spent performing gcr requests in metadata tag. " = 0xb1, 
                            "GL2C_PERF_SEL_MDC_REQ  :  Number of requests passed through the metadata cache. " = 0xb2, 
                            "GL2C_PERF_SEL_MDC_LEVEL  :  The sum of the number of mdc requests in flight.  Average MDC latency=GL2C_PERF_SEL_MDC_LEVEL/GL2C_PERF_SEL_MDC_REQ. " = 0xb3, 
                            "GL2C_PERF_SEL_MDC_TAG_HIT  :  Number of MDC tag hits.  A tag contains multiple sectors, so many tag hits will be sector misses. " = 0xb4, 
