    Z_WR_POLICY  1:0  ALPHA {"CACHE_LRU_WR  :  The store request is written into the cache wo/ immediately propagating to memory (stays dirty). " = 0x0, 
                            "CACHE_STREAM  :  The write request is written into the cache wo/ immediately propagating to memory. " = 0x1, 
                            "CACHE_NOA_WR  :  The write request can 'hit' in the cache if the line is already present, but will not allocate a new line on a miss (no allocate). " = 0x2, 
