                            "PERF_ENGG_CSB_DELAY_BIN00  :  PAPC_PERF_SEL_ENGG_CSB_DELAY_BIN00    Number of clocks on average between GE_PA_csb_send signals.  Resolution R set by PA_CL_ENHANCE.TC_LATENCY_TIME_STAMP_RESOLUTION.  Each count represents an average of R/2 clocks; range-1/clk; can be used in NGG perf analysis.  All instances report the same result " = 0xc5, 
