                            "PH_PERF_SEL_SC2_ARB_STARVED_FROM_ABOVE_WITH_UNSELECTED_FIFO_FULL  :  PH_PERF_SEL_SC2_ARB_STARVED_FROM_ABOVE_WITH_UNSELECTED_FIFO_FULL counts starved by pa with a unselected pa fifo full (use if more than one pa only) This means that inside the draw packet the SC selected fifo has no valid data, and that one of the unselected fifo's has gone fifo's has gone full. " = 0xf7, 
