                            "PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_XFC_ALL_EVENT_OR_PRIM_CYCLES  :  PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_XFC_ALL_EVENT_OR_PRIM_CYCLES counts number of cycles of arb xfc's for all event or prims " = 0x1, 
                            "PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_XFC_ONLY_PRIM_CYCLES  :  PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_XFC_ONLY_PRIM_CYCLES counts number of cycles of arb xfc's for only prims (events excluded) " = 0x2, 
                            "PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_XFC_ONLY_ONE_INC_PER_PRIM  :  PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_XFC_ONLY_ONE_INC_PER_PRIM counts number of cycles of arb xfc's for one inc per prim only. Increments only for phase 0 of a multi-cycle primitive transfer " = 0x3, 
                            "PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_STALLED_FROM_BELOW  :  PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_STALLED_FROM_BELOW counts number of cycles of stalled post arbiter for valid data " = 0x4, 
                            "PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_STARVED_FROM_ABOVE  :  PH_PERF_SEL_SC0_ARB_STARVED_FROM_ABOVE counts number of cycles of PA starving SC in start-of-packet/eop range " = 0x5, 
