    PERF_SEL1  19:10  ALPHA {"SC_SRPS_WINDOW_VALID  :  SC_PERF_SEL_SC_SRPS_WINDOW_VALID              Counts PERFCOUNTER_START to PERFCOUNTER_STOP stop perfcounter enable window for specific points in the SC pipeline. Number of clocks event-window is valid ;
Where measured:  at stage register/primitive setup bottom (below pbb if present at push into sc_ps_eng);
