                            "SC_BM_BE3_STALLED  :  SC_PERF_SEL_SC_BM_BE3_STALLED. Backend mapper ready to send stalled by backend3. Note to synchronize across multiple physical tiles the grbm read of this counter must be preceeded by a CONTEXT_DONE event.;
