increment rate-one per clock ;
range-1/clk;
CONTEXT_STATE_SENSITIVE=NO;
Results reported per SE and INSTANCE_INDEX 0 to num_packer_per_sc-1.
 " = 0x3, 
                            "SC_TRPK_WINDOW_VALID  :  SC_PERF_SEL_SC_TRPK_WINDOW_VALID              Number of clocks event-window is valid at tile reorder/packer ;
