Results reported per SE and INSTANCE_INDEX 0 to num_packer_per_sc-1.
 " = 0x4, 
                            "SC_SRPS_WINDOW_VALID_BUSY  :  SC_PERF_SEL_SC_SRPS_WINDOW_VALID_BUSY         Number of clocks event-window is valid at stage register/primitive setup with SC busy
