 " = 0xb, 
                            "SC_STALLED_BY_DB_TILE  :  SC_PERF_SEL_SC_STALLED_BY_DB_TILE             sc stalled by db tile. Tile picker(s) contain tiles to send in db_pipe(s) but is stalled by SC_DB_tile interface credits (Non-harvestable) ;
