 " = 0xc, 
                            "SC_STARVED_BY_DB_TILE  :  SC_PERF_SEL_SC_STARVED_BY_DB_TILE             sc starved by db tile. SC is waiting for tiles back from the db. This will always be the case for the first few transactions (repeater delays + db transaction latency). (Non-harvestable) ;
