    PERF_SEL  9:0  ALPHA {"SC_SRPS_WINDOW_VALID  :  SC_PERF_SEL_SC_SRPS_WINDOW_VALID              Counts PERFCOUNTER_START to PERFCOUNTER_STOP stop perfcounter enable window for specific points in the SC pipeline. Number of clocks event-window is valid ;
